  "content": "<h1>传送枪模组</h1>\n<p>基于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fportal-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iPortalTeam 的传送枪模组</a>，为 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a> 重新实现的版本。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2023/03/19/mxdDAr76Y3RwV9B.png\" alt=\"portal_gun.png\" width=\"300\"></p>\n<h3>前置要求</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-portals-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式传送门 (用于 Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2023/03/19/qz5fNVnZCgytJUX.png\" alt=\"portal_gun_recipe.png\" width=\"200\"></p>\n<h3>致谢</h3>\n<p>特别感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/iPortalTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iPortalTeam</a> 创建了原始模组，以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Thelnfamous1/PortalGun/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thelnfamous1</a> 完成了 1.19.2 Forge 版本的移植工作。</p>",
